#BNF+IAT 1.0 UTF-8;
!grammar call;
!slot <room>;
!start <callstart>;
<callstart>:<wake>|<querytemp>|<goto>|<hot>|<fanon>|<fanoff>|<lighton>|<lightoff>|<cuopen>|<cuclose>|<stop>;
<wake>:老张同学;
<querytemp>:查询室内温度;
<room>:厨房|卧室|书房|客厅;
<goto>:导航到<room>;
<hot>:我有点热;
<fanon>:打开厨房风扇;
<fanoff>:关闭厨房风扇;
<lighton>:打开卧室灯;
<lightoff>:关闭卧室灯;
<cuopen>:打开卧室窗帘;
<cuclose>:关闭卧室窗帘;
<stop>:结束语音交互;
